1
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,479
Give me the bag.

2
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:44,880
Let's go.

3
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,759
Should we go help the new transfer student?

4
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:52,300
There's nothing we can do.

5
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:54,080
This world has its own order.

6
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,620
Helping the weak casually

7
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,850
will only get you deeply involved.

8
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,360
You'll become another him.

9
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,449
What are you looking at?

10
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,440
Do you like sci-fi too?

11
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,840
What about you, Mala?

12
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,980
What year and month were you born?

13
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,010
I was born later than all of you.

14
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,640
But I'm older than you.

15
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,680
What nonsense is this?

16
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,690
This is my secret with time.

17
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,160
What's wrong?

18
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,320
Nothing.

19
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,040
I'm fine.

20
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,440
What are you looking for?

21
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,240
N-Nothing.

22
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,080
Is this what you're looking for?

23
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,850
You've been lying to me.

24
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,520
So you've been lying to me

25
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,240
and hiding it from me for so many years.

26
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,040
Why did you lie to me?

27
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:32,120
What's wrong?

28
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:32,800
Xiaotao.

29
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,740
Xiaotao fell down.

30
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,079
I saw a man in black.

31
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:36,960
You saw him?

32
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:38,079
Where?

33
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,000
There.

34
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:43,930
Wait for me here.

35
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,800
What happened?

36
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,560
I'm scared.

37
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,640
I'm scared.

38
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,680
What's wrong?

39
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,040
I'm scared.

40
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,240
I'm so scared.

41
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,610
Don't be afraid.

42
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:12,290
Let's go take a look.

43
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,680
Xiaotao, Xiaotao.

44
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,520
Calm down.

45
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:45,200
Think carefully about what you saw earlier.

46
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,840
I think I saw a person in black

47
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:51,520
push Xiaotao off the second floor.

48
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,050
Did you see the face?

49
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,040
I think it was Zhiwei.

50
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,010
I was in the restroom

51
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:06,140
and heard them having an unpleasant conversation.

52
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,360
Twice.

53
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,800
Then do you think

54
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,000
Li Zhiwei is a good guy?

55
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,600
I trust him.

56
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:37,680
Hurry up. We need to leave here as soon as possible.

57
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,560
Hurry and close the door.

58
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,820
Don't wait here to die.

59
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,700
Where on earth did Xiaotao go?

60
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,000
I don't know.

61
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:51,200
That cliff is very deep.

62
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:52,320
I don't know where they went.

63
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:54,360
I saw Xiaotao fall with my own eyes.

64
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:56,800
You went to look for Xiaotao.

65
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,200
And then he disappeared.

66
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,040
You mentioned a sixth person.

67
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,880
We haven't seen them at all.

68
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:03,880
What do you mean?

69
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:10,050
Even you guys don't believe me?

70
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:14,090
No matter how bad I am, I wouldn't kill anyone.

71
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,530
You've become a stranger to us.

72
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,540
If you don't explain clearly,

73
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,700
we can't feel safe riding in your car.

74
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:30,000
I just want everyone to get through tonight safely.

75
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,800
Then what exactly are you hiding?

76
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,800
Tell us right now.

77
00:06:34,159 --> 00:06:35,320
As long as we survive,

78
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,080
as long as we can get down the mountain,

79
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,540
I'll tell you everything.

80
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,409
The engine won't start.

81
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:14,720
It's Mala.

82
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,320
Mala.

83
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:32,400
If you're still alive,

84
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,320
come out and see me.

85
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:37,120
What's wrong now?

86
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,930
The car has been tampered with.

87
00:07:44,159 --> 00:07:45,640
We can't leave.

88
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,400
Why are you calling Mala?

89
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,800
Did you see him?

90
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,400
That person wearing a helmet

91
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,930
looks a lot like him.

92
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,600
Even if Mara really comes,

93
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,360
what are you so afraid of?

94
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,200
Power outages during thunderstorms are normal.

95
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,520
There's no one else here for now.

96
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:06,840
We are safe.

97
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,440
If that person wearing a helmet

98
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:09,760
really comes back,

99
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:13,420
we'll lock the doors and windows and figure something out.

100
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:15,080
That's all we can do.

101
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,320
You guys wait here.

102
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,640
I'll go check around.

103
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,960
Botulinum toxin.

104
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,680
Xiaofei was poisoned by this.

105
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:27,810
The only person in this whole villa who could have this is

106
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,240
Sophie.
